    "description": "You have an extraordinarily strong connection to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Living_Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Living Force\">The Living Force</a>. Whenever you roll a Natural 20 on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check, you gain one temporary <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>. If the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> is not used by the end of the encounter, it is lost. You cannot take this Talent if you already possess the <b>Force Flow</b> Talent, and vice versa.",
